	measure 'Product Performance Tier Colors (classified) YTD (_2011)' = ```
			
			VAR _revenue = [Net Revenue per Product YTD (_2011)]
			VAR _volume = [Product Transaction Volume (classified) YTD (_2011)]
			VAR _highRevenue = _revenue >= 20000
			VAR _highVolume = _volume >= 600
			RETURN 
			    SWITCH(
			        TRUE(),
			        _highRevenue && _highVolume, "#1f7a1f",         -- stars
			        _highRevenue && NOT(_highVolume), "#1f4e79",    -- premium
			        NOT(_highRevenue) && _highVolume, "#d67e00",    -- volume
			        "#767676"
			    )
			```
		displayFolder: _2011_Anchor\Sales\transactions_classified
		lineageTag: 39fa1629-5c4a-45ed-b8e1-9035fc05a05d

